      "text": [
        {
          "id": "title",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "#0 · \"Arrival\" (paraphrased); the title exchange at q001",
          "title": "The resignation that becomes an address",
          "italic": "The opening act demonstrates assignment: the inquiry into who may order the field is redirected into an order within that field — \"You are Number Six.\"",
          "body": "",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.05,
          "width": 560,
          "size": 30,
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "id": "body1",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "An intelligence agent resigns; before he can carry that decision into another life he is abducted, waking in surroundings resembling his own room — now belonging to the Village. The administration wants the reason for his resignation: it knows much, and seeks cooperation in completing the account. Its visible chief is Number Two; his own designation is Number Six. \"Arrival\" gives the arrangement material actors: technicians watching, Rover",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 620,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left",
          "w": 520
        },
        {
          "id": "body2",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "intercepting escape, the colleague Cobb apparently dead, Number Nine's escape arrangement ending in a remotely controlled helicopter, and another man already installed as Number Two. The title exchange compresses the situation — \"Who is Number One?\" / \"You are Number Six.\" / \"I am not a number; I am a free man!\" — and Two's laughter follows. There is no comma after \"are\": the reply assigns the questioner's number; it does not conceal an identity.\n\nOccurrences: the resignation and abduction (#0); Rover and the helicopter (#0); Cobb and Number Nine (#0); the title exchange (#0, #3).",
          "x": 0.6,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 505,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left"
        }
      ],
